<title>NEW ZEALAND: Designer Textiles 9-mth loss NZ$7.12 mln.</title>
<headline>Designer Textiles 9-mth loss NZ$7.12 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine month result to Dec 31.</p>
<p>			   (million NZ$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net loss				7.12 vs 0.81 profit</p>
<p>    Shr (cents)		    loss 27.9 vs 6.1 profit</p>
<p>    Div (cents)			    2.0 vs n/a</p>
<p>    Turnover			     23.75 vs 9.33</p>
<p>    Pretax loss			   6.23 vs 1.15 profit</p>
<p>    Tax				     0.89 vs 0.34</p>
<p>    Abnormals: goodwill write-off   8.77 vs n/a</p>
<p>    Shares outstanding (million)   29.74 vs 15.7</p>
<p>Dividend carries full imputation credit.</p>
<p>Pay date April 4</p>
<p>Reg date March 21</p>
<p>    Ex div   March 24</p>
<p>Note - Designer Textiles Ltd is a fabrics designer.</p>
<p>-- Wellington Newsroom (64 4) 4734746</p>
